# The six ways to move, and what each does at an edge. Left at the start of
# a line goes to the end of the one above rather than stopping, which is
# what makes a document feel like text and not like a grid; Right at the end
# of the last line has nowhere to go and stays.
name move.pas
size 8 20
push alpha
push be
push gamma
draw
esc B
esc C
esc C
draw
esc C
esc C
draw
esc D
draw
esc A
draw
